  "Complete compliment sequence demonstrated — Present Arms, Let Fly, Catch, Shoulder Arms. All 10 ceremonial drill missions complete. Outstanding work, Drill Cadet. You are ready for the parade ground.": "Completer Séquence de compliment demonstrated — Présentez Les Armes, Lachez, Attraper, Épaule Armes. Tout 10 Cérémonial exercice Missions accomplies. Outstanding travail, Cadet De Drill. Vous etes pret pour le parade sol.",
