  "Danger — Check the scene is safe": "Danger — Vérifier que la scène est sûre",
  "Dangerous. Dead overhead branches can fall without warning (widowmakers).": "Dangereux. Dead overhead branches peut tomber sans avertissement (widowmakers).",
  "Dark squall line dead ahead — wind veering, seas building.": "Obscurite squall ligne dead ahead — vent veering, seas batiment.",
  "Dark yellow urine, headache, dizziness, and dry mouth": "Obscurite yellow urine, headache, dizziness, et secher Bouche",
  "Day": "Jour",
