  "Decode a NATO phonetic alphabet message in the Radio room.": "Decode a OTAN Alphabet phonétique message dans le Radio piece.",
  "Decode each phonetic code word to its letter, then enter the four-letter word below:</div></div>": "Décodez chaque mot de code phonétique en sa lettre, puis entrez le mot de quatre lettres ci-dessous :</div></div>",
  "Decode runway numbers and orientation.": "Decode piste nombres et Orientation.",
  "Decode the Runway Number": "Decode le Piste Nombre",
  "Decode the standard map symbols used on topographic maps — from roads and buildings to water features and vegetation.": "Décodez les symboles de carte standard utilisés sur les cartes topographiques — des routes et bâtiments aux éléments aquatiques et à la végétation.",
  "Decreasing airspeed": "Diminuant Vitesse air",
  "Dedicated lookout posted — MOB kept in sight, pointing continuously.": "Veilleur dédié en poste — l'homme à la mer gardé en vue, pointant en continu.",
  "Defend the digital frontier — close every ticket.": "Defendre le numerique frontier — fermer chaque ticket.",
  "Define attention, stand at ease, and stand easy.": "Define attention, se tenir Repos, et Se reposer.",
  "Define exactly what you want to achieve": "Définir exactement ce que vous voulez accomplir",
  "Define fundamental nautical terms: port, starboard, bow, stern, forward, aft.": "Define fundamental nautical termes: port, tribord, proue, poupe, EN AVANT, aft.",
  "Dehydrated": "Déshydraté",
  "Dehydration": "Deshydratation",
  "Dehydration becomes fatal after roughly three days.": "Deshydratation devient fatal apres roughly trois jours.",
  "Dehydration impairs judgement within a day. Find water early.": "Deshydratation impairs judgement dans a jour. Trouver eau tot.",
  "Dehydration sets in within 3 days. Find and purify water before anything else after shelter.": "La déshydratation s'installe en 3 jours. Trouvez et purifiez l'eau avant toute autre chose après l'abri.",
  "Deliver a clear verbal brief to a section of four cadets.": "Donner une directive verbale claire à une section de quatre cadets.",
  "Deliver a four-stage warm-up to a group of six cadets.": "Animer un échauffement en quatre étapes à un groupe de six cadets.",
  "Deliver a passenger safety briefing before a cadet air experience flight.": "Deliver a passager surete briefing avant a cadet air experience vol.",
  "Deliver the brief clearly and confirm understanding.": "Deliver le briefing clearly et confirmer understanding.",
  "Deliver up to 5 sharp back blows": "Deliver jusqu'a 5 diese dos souffle",
