  "Group huddle to share warmth and stay together.": "Se regrouper pour partager la chaleur et rester ensemble.",
  "Group participation practice": "Groupe participation pratique",
  "Group training includes several normal cadet accounts. maintenance script inherits group write permissions.": "Groupe formation inclut several normal cadet accounts. maintenance script inherits groupe ecrire Permissions.",
  "Guess based on how the sky looked yesterday.": "Deviner d'après l'aspect du ciel d'hier.",
  "Guess the symbol because all water areas are the same.": "Guess le symbole parce que tout eau zones sont le meme.",
  "Guess what is behind every tree.": "Guess qu'est-ce que derriere chaque arbre.",
  "Guide a cadet through the safe removal of the Daisy 853C from its case — 8 critical steps.": "Guide a cadet a travers le sur Retrait du Daisy 853C de son cas — 8 Critique etapes.",
  "Guide them down or forward safely with a spotter in position.": "Les guider vers le bas ou l'avant en toute sécurité avec un observateur en position.",
  "Guidelines for hydrating before, during, and after exercise.": "Guidelines pour hydrating avant, pendant, et apres exercice.",
  "Gulf": "Golf",
  "Gybing — turning the bow through the wind": "Gybing — tournant le proue a travers le vent",
  "HALF AHEAD": "DEMI EN AVANT",
