  "MOB marker, very close": "MOB marker, tres fermer",
  "MOB procedure confirmed — shout, throw, keep sight, recover. Never lose visual contact.": "MOB procedure Confirmé — shout, lancer, garder visee, recuperer. Jamais perdre visual contact.",
  "MOB! The first action is to raise the alarm. Transmit a PAN-PAN distress call on VHF Channel 16.": "HDM ! La première action est de donner l'alerte. Transmettez un appel de détresse PAN-PAN sur le canal VHF 16.",
