  "Mark reached! You tacked upwind to the finish.": "Marque atteinte ! Vous avez viré vent debout jusqu'à l'arrivée.",
  "Mark the case confidential and document who has access to the evidence.": "Mark le cas confidential et document qui a acces au evidence.",
