  "Mayday Mayday, Cadet GAB, coming in to land, get out of the way.": "Mayday Mayday, Cadet GAB, j'arrive pour atterrir, dégagez la piste.",
  "Mayday, Mayday, Mayday. This is Cadet Adventurer, Cadet Adventurer, Cadet Adventurer. Mayday. Position: five miles south of South Head. Taking on water. Six persons aboard. Require immediate assistance. Over.": "Mayday, Mayday, Mayday. Ici Cadet Aventurier, Cadet Aventurier, Cadet Aventurier. Mayday. Position : cinq milles au sud de South Head. Nous prenons l'eau. Six personnes à bord. Demandons une assistance immédiate. À vous.",
