  "Oxygen feeds the fire. Build with space for airflow — don't smother it.": "Oxygen feeds le feu. Construire avec espace pour airflow — don't smother it.",
  "PACE RUN": "PAS COURIR",
  "PAN-PAN, PAN-PAN, PAN-PAN transmitted on Ch 16 — man overboard alarm raised.": "PAN-PAN, PAN-PAN, PAN-PAN transmis sur le canal 16 — alarme d'homme à la mer déclenchée.",
