  "Reflection turns experience into wisdom — you understand its true value.": "Reflection tourne experience dans wisdom — vous comprenez son vrai valeur.",
  "Reflection<br>Bench": "Banc<br>de réflexion",
  "Regular weekly training nights only": "Regulier weekly formation nights seulement",
