  "Reverse arms described correctly — rifle inverted as a mark of respect.": "Arme inversée décrite correctement — fusil renversé en signe de respect.",
  "Reverse arms usage confirmed — funeral drill, memorial services, and solemn respects.": "Arme inversée Utilisation Confirmé — funeral exercice, memorial services, et solemn respects.",
  "Review Domain Admin changes and scheduled task deployment.": "Examen Domaine Admin change et scheduled tache deployment.",
