  "Six-pack instruments, simulator flying, and situational awareness.": "Six-sac instruments, simulator vol, et situational awareness.",
  "Skin Tone": "Peau Ton",
  "Skip stretching and go straight to lifting": "Sauter les étirements et passer directement à l'haltérophilie",
  "Skipping Rope": "Skipping Corde",
  "Skipping cool-down means stiff muscles and slower recovery. Static stretches and gradual heart-rate reduction are essential.": "Skipping refroidir-en bas means stiff muscles et slower recuperation. Grillement stretches et gradual coeur-taux reduction sont essential.",
  "Skipping warm-up increases injury risk. Dynamic stretches prepare muscles for activity and reduce strain.": "Skipping Échauffement augmente blessure risque. Étirements dynamiques preparer muscles pour activite et reduire elongation.",
  "Slap their cheeks hard": "Slap leur cheeks difficile",
  "Slap them on the back harder": "Slap les sur le dos harder",
