  "Whoever is faster has right of way and can overtake.": "Celui qui est le plus rapide a la priorité et peut doubler.",
  "Why 100–120 compressions per minute matters, and how to keep the right tempo.": "Pourquoi 100–120 compressions per minute matters, et comment garder la droite tempo.",
