  "s Bell\",\n          prompt: \"Switch to the Log Book. Write a short note on the ship": "s Bell\",\n          prompt: \"Passez au Journal Livre. Ecrire a courte note sur le navire",
  "s Primary Role\",\n        prompt: \"In a pipe band, what is the bass drummer": "s Primary Role\",\n        prompt: \"In a cornemuse fanfare, qu'est-ce que le bass drummer",
  "s ability to lengthen; mobility is a joint": "s capacité à s'allonger ; la mobilité est une articulation",
  "s kitchen\",\n          proof: \"Naval term confirmed — the galley is the ship": "s kitchen\",\n          proof: \"Naval terme Confirmé — le galley est le navire",
  "s pipes, the phonetic alphabet, and semaphore — the voice and signal traditions of the sea.\",\n      xp: 100,\n      brief: \"You are at the communications desk. Your quartermaster wants you to learn the special language of the sea — naval terms, the boatswain": "s cornemuses, le Alphabet phonétique, et semaphore — le voix et signal traditions du mer.\",\n      xp: 100,\n      briefing: \"Vous etes au Communications desk. Votre quartermaster veut que vous apprenez le special language du mer — Naval termes, le boatswain",
